        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>50个行为经济学概念</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 8px 8px 12px 8px;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #000000;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding: 6px 10px 10px 10px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n  .term {\n    width: 185px;\n    flex: 0 0 185px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 6px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    padding: 8px 10px 8px 22px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .desc::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 8px;\n    top: 6px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n\n  /* Row color pairs */\n  .t1 { background: #f2861e; }\n  .d1 { background: #fbe4e4; }\n\n  .t2 { background: #9e9e9e; }\n  .d2 { background: #eaeaea; }\n\n  .t3 { background: #f5c518; }\n  .d3 { background: #fdf3e0; }\n\n  .t4 { background: #2f7fd1; }\n  .d4 { background: #e2eef8; }\n\n  .t5 { background: #6cbf5a; }\n  .d5 { background: #e8f4e4; }\n\n  .t6 { background: #f2861e; }\n  .d6 { background: #fbe4e4; }\n\n  .t7 { background: #9e9e9e; }\n  .d7 { background: #eaeaea; }\n\n  .t8 { background: #7bbf5f; }\n  .d8 { background: #fdf6e0; }\n\n  .t9 { background: #4f9fd6; }\n  .d9 { background: #e2eef8; }\n\n  .t10 { background: #7ec98a; }\n  .d10 { background: #eaf4ea; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">50个行为经济学概念</div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t1\">内在动机（Intrinsic<br>Motivation）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d1\">基于内在兴趣和满足感进行行动的动机，而非外部奖励或惩罚。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t2\">比较效用（Relative<br>Utility）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d2\">人们对于收益和满足感的评估通常是基于相对参照点的比较，而非绝对数值。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t3\">消费者无知<br>（Consumer<br>Ignorance）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d3\">消费者对于市场信息和产品特性的缺乏了解，导致决策受到影响。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t4\">合作与竞争<br>（Cooperation vs.<br>Competition）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d4\">人们在决策和行为中受到与他人合作或竞争的影响，从而改变决策策略。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t5\">持续效应（Sunk Cost<br>Fallacy）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d5\">人们倾向于将过去已经发生的成本视为不可逆转，继续投入资源，即使当前决策并不理性。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t6\">心理账户（Mental<br>Account）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d6\">人们对于不同资金来源的分配和使用会有不同的偏好和行为，形成不同的心理账户。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t7\">失败回避（Loss<br>Avoidance）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d7\">人们更倾向于避免损失而非追求收益，因此在决策中可能会选择保守的选择。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t8\">群体迷思（Groupthink）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d8\">在群体中，人们为了与他人保持一致和获得认同而放弃独立思考，导致决策偏差。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t9\">时间不一致（Time<br>Inconsistency）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d9\">人们在时间跨度较长的决策中容易受到即时满足的影响，而忽视长期利益。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"term t10\">心理障碍<br>（Psychological<br>Barrier）</div>\n    <div class=\"desc d10\">人们在决策中受到情绪、态度和信念等心理因素的影响，产生决策偏差。</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
